    category: "Linux",
    title: "Linux Mint 27 預計於聖誕節發布，基於 Ubuntu 26.04 LTS，並大幅提升 Wayland 相容性",
    summary: "Linux Mint 開發團隊宣布，Linux Mint 27 版本將延續其較長的發布週期，目標在聖誕節前發布。該版本將基於 Ubuntu 26.04 LTS，並預計包含 Cinnamon、Xfce 和 MATE 等多種桌面環境。開發創始人 Clement Lefebvre 表示，從原有的半年發布週期轉變為年度發布，讓團隊有充裕的時間進行開發，得以實施以往認為過大或過於雄心勃勃的專案和功能。除了新增功能外，開發團隊也投入大量時間修復了大量的 Bug，並特別著重於提升 Wayland 的相容性。Linux Mint 27 將取代 Linux Mint 22.3，代表了年度的迭代。這顯示了 Linux Mint 在系統穩定性、功能豐富度以及現代化介面支援（如 Wayland）方面的持續進步。",
    tags: ["Linux Mint", "Linux 核心", "Ubuntu 26.04 LTS", "Wayland", "Cinnamon", "Xfce", "MATE"],
    title_en: "Linux Mint 27 Expected for Christmas Release, Based on Ubuntu 26.04 LTS, with Enhanced Wayland Compatibility",
    summary_en: "The Linux Mint development team announced that Linux Mint 27 will continue its extended release cycle, targeting a release before Christmas. This version will be based on Ubuntu 26.04 LTS and is expected to include multiple desktop environments such as Cinnamon, Xfce, and MATE. Development founder Clement Lefebvre stated that transitioning from the previous six-month release cycle to an annual cycle gives the team ample time for development, allowing them to implement projects and features previously considered too large or too ambitious. In addition to new features, the development team has dedicated significant time to fixing numerous bugs, with a special focus on improving Wayland compatibility. Linux Mint 27 will succeed Linux Mint 22.3, representing an annual iteration. This demonstrates Linux Mint's continuous progress in system stability, feature richness, and modern interface support (such as Wayland).",
