    summary: "Apple 今日發布了以 Siri AI 為核心的新型 HomeView 智慧顯示器產品，並開放預購。然而，該產品目前無法在歐盟（EU）銷售。Apple 官方解釋，延遲上市的原因是 Siri AI 功能目前尚未在歐盟的 iOS 系統中支援。文章指出，雖然 Siri AI 已在 macOS Golden Gate 和 visionOS 27 等平台提供，但由於歐盟的《數位市場法案》（Digital Markets Act）規定，Apple 認為若在歐盟推出 HomeView，必須禁用與 Siri AI 相關的個人化情境功能，導致用戶體驗受損。因此，Apple 決定暫緩發布，直到 Siri AI 能全面支援歐盟的 iPhone 用戶。這顯示了跨平台功能與區域法規限制之間的複雜關係。",
    tags: ["Apple", "HomeView", "Siri AI", "iOS", "macOS", "歐盟", "Digital Markets Act"],
    title_en: "Apple delays HomeView smart display launch in EU due to pending Siri AI functionality on iOS",
    summary_en: "Apple today unveiled its new HomeView smart display, which is centered around Siri AI, and opened pre-orders. However, the product is currently unavailable for sale in the European Union (EU). Apple officially explained that the delay is because the Siri AI functionality is not yet supported on iOS systems within the EU. The article points out that while Siri AI is available on platforms like macOS Golden Gate and visionOS 27, Apple believes that if HomeView were launched in the EU, it would require disabling personalized contextual features related to Siri AI due to the EU's Digital Markets Act (DMA). This would degrade the user experience. Consequently, Apple has decided to postpone the launch until Siri AI can be fully supported for iPhone users in the EU. This highlights the complex relationship between cross-platform functionality and regional regulatory restrictions.",
