    summary: "本文介紹Addigy的Intelligence Suite，該套件旨在提供一套整合性的Apple設備管理與安全解決方案。該產品透過單一專業級平台，協助企業自動化部署、管理和保護Apple設備。Addigy的解決方案能夠讓超過45,000個組織信任其能力，輕鬆且經濟地讓數百萬台Apple設備投入使用。該套件的重點在於提供全面的管理能力，讓企業在工作環境中更順暢地使用Apple設備。本文內容為節目訪談形式，詳細介紹了Intelligence Suite的功能與應用。",
    tags: ["Addigy", "Intelligence Suite", "Apple設備管理", "Apple Unified Platform", "企業安全", "Apple"],
    title_en: "Addigy Launches Intelligence Suite: Integrating Apple Device Management and Security Solutions",
    summary_en: "This article introduces Addigy's Intelligence Suite, a comprehensive solution designed to provide integrated Apple device management and security capabilities. Through a single professional platform, the product helps enterprises automate the deployment, management, and protection of Apple devices. Addigy's solution is trusted by over 45,000 organizations, enabling the efficient and cost-effective deployment of millions of Apple devices. The suite focuses on providing comprehensive management capabilities, allowing businesses to utilize Apple devices more smoothly in their work environment. The content is presented in an interview format, detailing the features and applications of the Intelligence Suite.",
