    title: "iPhone Duo 採用柔性石墨管於<0xE9><0x89><0xB8>接處，提升 A20 Pro 晶片散熱效率",
    summary: "蘋果公司在設計 iPhone Duo 的 A20 Pro 晶片時，為應對折疊機型在散熱上的挑戰，採用了創新的工程解決方案。A20 Pro 是蘋果首款基於 2 nm 製程的晶片，搭載於 iPhone 18 Pro、iPhone 18 Pro Max 和 iPhone Duo 上。針對 iPhone Duo，蘋果額外增加了第二個顯示引擎，以支援內外螢幕的同時運作，並在晶片上增加了 FaceTime 鏡頭的支援。為優化散熱，蘋果開發了「metal over foam」材料，用於在 A20 Pro 晶片與均熱板之間建立熱學和機械上相容的耦合。最關鍵的技術突破是，蘋果將一根柔性石墨管路徑穿過機身<0xE9><0x89><0xB8>接處，從而將熱能從兩半設備之間傳輸，大幅增加了散熱表面積，確保了產品在折疊循環中的結構完整性與熱傳導效率。",
    tags: ["Apple", "iPhone Duo", "A20 Pro", "2 nm", "散熱技術", "柔性石墨管"],
    title_en: "iPhone Duo adopts flexible graphite tubes at the hinge to improve A20 Pro chip cooling efficiency",
    summary_en: "Apple implemented an innovative engineering solution when designing the A20 Pro chip for the iPhone Duo, addressing the cooling challenges inherent in foldable devices. The A20 Pro is Apple's first chip based on the 2 nm process, powering the iPhone 18 Pro, iPhone 18 Pro Max, and iPhone Duo. For the iPhone Duo, Apple additionally incorporated a second display engine to support simultaneous operation of both inner and outer screens, and added support for the FaceTime camera on the chip. To optimize heat dissipation, Apple developed a 'metal over foam' material used to establish a thermally and mechanically compatible coupling between the A20 Pro chip and the thermal spreader. The most critical technical breakthrough is Apple's integration of a flexible graphite tube pathway through the device's hinge, which transfers heat energy between the two halves of the device. This significantly increases the cooling surface area, ensuring both the structural integrity and thermal conduction efficiency of the product during folding cycles.",
