    title: "Apple 推出 HomeView 智慧家庭中樞，整合 Apple Intelligence 與安全功能",
    summary: "Apple 今日開放預購 HomeView 智慧家庭中樞。這款 7 吋智慧顯示器和揚聲器，旨在成為家庭成員（最多六人）控制 Apple 生態系統設備、應用程式和 Siri 生成式 AI 聊天機器人的中央接入點。HomeView 可透過語音指令控制智慧家庭設備，例如關閉智慧百葉窗或啟動智慧門鎖。它還支援同時顯示多達九個視訊串流。透過支援 iCloud+ 訂閱，HomeView 可與相容攝影機協作，提供端到端加密的人臉、寵物、包裹和車輛識別，並在有人抵達時通知家庭。此外，它還能為 HomeKit Secure Video 畫面提供視訊描述，讓使用者無需觀看即可了解事件內容。HomeView 具備整合攝影機，可識別使用者並顯示個人化設定檔，並可與支援 Apple Intelligence 的 iPhone 或 iPad 連結，讓使用者透過中樞存取訊息、行事曆、提醒事項和 FaceTime 等個人資訊。",
    tags: ["Apple", "HomeView", "Apple Intelligence", "HomeKit", "智慧家庭", "iOS"],
    title_en: "Apple launches HomeView smart home hub, integrating Apple Intelligence and advanced security features",
    summary_en: "Apple today opened pre-orders for the HomeView smart home hub. This 7-inch smart display and speaker is designed to be the central access point for family members (up to six people) to control Apple ecosystem devices, applications, and Siri generative AI chatbots. HomeView can control smart home devices via voice commands, such as closing smart blinds or activating smart locks. It also supports displaying up to nine simultaneous video streams. By supporting iCloud+ subscriptions, HomeView can collaborate with compatible cameras to provide end-to-end encrypted facial, pet, package, and vehicle recognition, and notify the family when someone arrives. Furthermore, it provides video descriptions for HomeKit Secure Video footage, allowing users to understand event content without needing to watch it. HomeView features integrated cameras that can identify users and display personalized profiles, and can connect to iPhones or iPads supporting Apple Intelligence, allowing users to access personal information such as messages, calendars, reminders, and FaceTime through the hub.",
