    title: "Google Android Auto 18.0 開始滾動更新，持續為代號「Cielo」的介面大改版鋪路",
    summary: "Google 正開始以 Beta 形式滾動發布 Android Auto 18.0 更新。雖然版本號看似里程碑，但本次更新本身缺乏新用戶可見功能，主要為例行錯誤修復。然而，分析發現新的資產名稱「cielo_launcher」的出現，強烈暗示了這代號為「Cielo」的下一代 Android Auto 介面大改版正在醞釀。此前，Google 在 Android Auto 的旗標（flags）中已多次提及「Cielo」，而「Cielo」在義大利語和西班牙語中意指「天空」。此次更新也持續展示了新的螢幕佈局，預計能更廣泛地覆蓋顯示空間並支援更多小工具。雖然 18.0 本身尚未帶來重大功能，但其更新內容和代號的持續曝光，顯示 Google 正在逐步為這場重大的使用者介面升級做準備。",
    tags: ["Google", "Android Auto", "Android 18.0", "Cielo", "使用者介面", "Beta 更新"],
    title_en: "Google Android Auto 18.0 Rolling Update Begins, Paving the Way for Major 'Cielo' Interface Overhaul",
    summary_en: "Google has begun rolling out the Android Auto 18.0 update in Beta form. Although the version number appears to be a milestone, the update itself lacks visible new features for end-users and primarily consists of routine bug fixes. However, analysis revealed the appearance of a new asset name, 'cielo_launcher,' strongly suggesting that a major overhaul of the next-generation Android Auto interface, codenamed 'Cielo,' is underway. Previously, Google had repeatedly mentioned 'Cielo' within Android Auto flags. 'Cielo' means 'sky' in Italian and Spanish. This update also continues to showcase new screen layouts, which are expected to cover display space more broadly and support more widgets. While 18.0 itself does not bring major features, its update content and the continued exposure of the codename indicate that Google is gradually preparing for this significant user interface upgrade.",
