    title: "Google 擴充 Android Automotive 平台功能，為車載系統帶來背景播放與更豐富的應用生態",
    summary: "Google 正在為其 Android Automotive 系統推出多項應用程式更新，旨在提升車載娛樂體驗與平台彈性。主要更新包括讓 YouTube 在行駛時也能支援背景播放功能（需 Premium 訂閱），使用戶在停車時觀看影片，恢復行駛後仍能持續收聽音訊。此外，車載系統的 Play Store 介面也將進行更新，設計更適應不同尺寸與方向的車用顯示器，並改善應用分類與發現性。Google 表示目前 Android Automotive 已擁有超過 700 個應用程式，未來還將加入 STARZ、Firefox、Ludo King 和 JioHotstar 等更多應用。這些更新旨在讓車用作業系統的應用生態更豐富、更具互動性，提升用戶在車內的數位體驗。",
    tags: ["Android Automotive", "Google", "YouTube", "背景播放", "車載系統", "Play Store"],
    title_en: "Google Enhances Android Automotive Platform with Background Playback and Richer Application Ecosystem",
    summary_en: "Google is rolling out several application updates for its Android Automotive system, aiming to enhance both the in-car entertainment experience and platform flexibility. Key updates include enabling YouTube to support background playback while driving (requires a Premium subscription), allowing users to watch videos while parked and continue listening to audio after resuming driving. Furthermore, the in-car Play Store interface will be updated to better suit various sizes and orientations of automotive displays, while also improving app categorization and discoverability. Google stated that Android Automotive currently boasts over 700 applications, with more joining in the future, including STARZ, Firefox, Ludo King, and JioHotstar. These updates are designed to enrich the application ecosystem of the automotive operating system, making it more interactive and elevating the user's digital experience while in the vehicle.",
