    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "Android",
    title: "Google Play Store升級：導入「Vibe-coded」應用、個人化應用庫與社群遊戲功能",
    summary: "Google Play Store宣布多項重大更新，旨在提升用戶的應用體驗和社群互動性。其中核心功能是支持「Vibe-coded」的 Android 應用，允許用戶在設備上啟動個人化應用，並透過「您的個人應用庫」一站式管理跨設備的應用。這些個人應用將保持安全、私密，並與公開商店目錄分開，初期適用於小規模分享，並需經過安全審核。\n此外，Play Store推出了「Game Finder」功能，透過分析用戶的「Gamer DNA」（遊戲偏好和遊玩習慣），幫助用戶精準發掘符合個人口味的遊戲，並提供社群參與度、熱門趨勢分析。遊戲功能也新增了「Game Playlists」讓用戶策劃和分享遊戲合集，並透過「Sprints」等高能微挑戰，強化了遊戲的社群競爭元素。這些更新預計將逐步推廣至美國及其他選定市場，旨在讓開發者能更便捷地部署應用，並提升整體生態系統的黏著度。",
    tags: ["Google Play Store", "Android", "Vibe-coded", "Game Finder", "個人化應用", "Play Store"],
    title_en: "Google Play Store Upgrade: Introducing 'Vibe-coded' Apps, Personalized App Library, and Social Gaming Features",
    summary_en: "The Google Play Store announced several major updates aimed at enhancing user application experience and social interactivity. A core feature is support for 'Vibe-coded' Android applications, which allow users to launch personalized applications directly on their device and manage cross-device apps through 'Your Personal App Library.' These personal applications will remain secure and private, separate from the public store directory, and will initially be limited to small-scale sharing and require security review. Additionally, the Play Store introduced 'Game Finder,' which analyzes users' 'Gamer DNA' (gaming preferences and habits) to help users discover games tailored to their tastes, and provides social engagement and trending analysis. Gaming features also added 'Game Playlists,' allowing users to curate and share game collections, and introduced high-intensity mini-challenges like 'Sprints' to strengthen the social competitive element of gaming. These updates are expected to be rolled out gradually to the US and other selected markets, aiming to make application deployment easier for developers and increase overall ecosystem stickiness.",
    tags_en: ["Google Play Store", "Android", "Vibe-coded", "Game Finder", "Personalized Apps", "Play Store"],
    sources: [
      { name: "9to5Google", url: "https://9to5google.com/2026/10/13/google-play-vibe-coded", lang: "EN" }
    ]
