    title: "Google Play Store整合AI功能：推出Ask Play擴展搜尋與Game Finder，強化應用程式發現體驗",
    summary: "Google持續在Play Store整合更多AI功能，旨在提升用戶的應用程式與遊戲發現體驗。其中，Ask Play功能已從單純的聊天機器人介面擴展，現在可以透過提問生成更廣泛的應用程式和遊戲推薦，甚至提供詳細的比較圖表。此外，Google還推出了Game Finder，這項功能利用Google多年累積的用戶使用數據，為全球12億名Android玩家建立「Gamer DNA」個人資料。用戶可以透過評分遊戲、調整標籤等方式來精準化自己的DNA，讓AI能提供更符合個人偏好的遊戲清單，例如放鬆、熱門或特定機制類型的遊戲。這些功能目前已在美國推出，其他市場將陸續跟進。這些AI工具的整合，顯示Google正朝向更智慧、更個人化的內容推薦系統發展。",
    tags: ["Google Play Store", "AI", "Ask Play", "Game Finder", "Android", "Gemini"],
    title_en: "Google Play Store Integrates AI Features: Introducing Ask Play for Enhanced Search and Game Finder",
    summary_en: "Google continues to integrate more AI functionalities into the Play Store, aiming to enhance the user experience for discovering applications and games. Specifically, the Ask Play feature has evolved beyond a simple chatbot interface; it can now generate broader recommendations for apps and games based on user queries, even providing detailed comparison charts. Furthermore, Google has launched Game Finder, a feature that utilizes years of accumulated user data to create a 'Gamer DNA' profile for its 1.2 billion Android players globally. Users can refine their DNA by rating games and adjusting tags, allowing the AI to provide highly personalized game lists tailored to individual preferences, such as relaxing, popular, or specific genre types. These features have been rolled out in the US and will be gradually expanded to other markets. The integration of these AI tools indicates Google's shift toward developing smarter, more personalized content recommendation systems.",
