    title: "Polaris Office App 9.9.19 存在路徑遍歷漏洞，Android 用戶需升級至 9.9.22 版本修復",
    summary: "Polaris Office App 9.9.19 在 Android 平台上發現了資安漏洞。此漏洞影響的是 Document Intake 組件中的 com.infraware.service.m.n.a 函式，攻擊者透過操縱 _display_name 參數，可能導致路徑遍歷（path traversal）的行為。該漏洞的攻擊條件為必須具備本地存取權限（local access）。由於此漏洞的利用程式已公開，存在被惡意利用的風險。供應商已確認修復方式，並指出已新增路徑驗證邏輯，確保檔案僅在指定的臨時目錄內建立。建議受影響用戶立即將 Polaris Office App 升級至版本 9.9.22 或更高版本，以修補此安全問題。",
    tags: ["Polaris Office", "Android", "路徑遍歷", "CVE-2026-109106", "資安漏洞"],
    title_en: "Polaris Office App 9.9.19 Contains Path Traversal Vulnerability; Android Users Must Upgrade to 9.9.22",
    summary_en: "A security vulnerability was discovered in Polaris Office App 9.9.19 on the Android platform. This vulnerability affects the `com.infraware.service.m.n.a` function within the Document Intake component. An attacker can potentially trigger path traversal by manipulating the `_display_name` parameter. The exploitation of this vulnerability requires local access. Given that exploit code for this vulnerability has been made public, there is a risk of malicious exploitation. The vendor has confirmed the fix, noting that path validation logic has been added to ensure files are created only within specified temporary directories. Affected users are advised to immediately upgrade the Polaris Office App to version 9.9.22 or higher to patch this security issue.",
