    title: "Google 重設計 Gemini 介面，整合 Spark 個人助理功能，優化任務與聊天體驗",
    summary: "Google 正在對 Gemini 聊天體驗進行重大介面重設計，旨在將其個人助理功能 Spark 更緊密地整合到主聊天介面中。使用者現在可以在提示框上方看到「Chat」和「Task」按鈕，其中「Task」即為 Gemini Spark，讓使用者可以隨時開始並追蹤任務。此變動導致原先的「Spark」功能從導航抽屜移除，取而代之的是一個新的「Scheduled」頁面，用於彙整活躍、暫停、已完成和建議的任務。此外，聊天記錄列表也從「Recents」更名，所有聊天和 Spark 任務現在合併到一個歷史記錄中，並提供更細緻的篩選功能。Google 透過此更新，顯然是在淡化「Spark」的品牌化，甚至將「Gemini Spark Settings」更名為「Task settings」。此更新透過伺服器端更新在 Android 上推出，但目前尚未在 iOS 或網頁版看到。此功能需要 AI Pro 或 AI Ultra 訂閱。",
    tags: ["Google", "Gemini", "Spark", "AI Pro", "AI Ultra", "Android"],
    title_en: "Google redesigns Gemini interface, integrating Spark personal assistant functionality to optimize task and chat experience",
    summary_en: "Google is undergoing a major redesign of the Gemini chat experience, aiming to integrate its personal assistant functionality, Spark, more closely into the main chat interface. Users can now see 'Chat' and 'Task' buttons above the prompt box, with 'Task' representing Gemini Spark, allowing users to start and track tasks anytime. This change has resulted in the original 'Spark' function being removed from the navigation drawer, replaced by a new 'Scheduled' page that aggregates active, paused, completed, and suggested tasks. Furthermore, the chat history list has been renamed from 'Recents'; all chats and Spark tasks are now merged into a single history, offering more granular filtering capabilities. Through this update, Google is clearly de-emphasizing the 'Spark' branding, even renaming 'Gemini Spark Settings' to 'Task settings'. This update was rolled out via a server-side update on Android, but is not yet visible on iOS or the web version. This feature requires an AI Pro or AI Ultra subscription.",
