    title: "Apple 宣布 Apple Home Collection，與 LG 及 Schneider Electric 合作推出智能家居配件",
    summary: "Apple 宣布推出 Apple Home Collection，這系列智能家居配件包括攝影機、恆溫器和門鎖，是與 LG Electronics 和 Schneider Electric 兩家第三方公司合作開發的。該系列旨在為用戶提供一套簡單、可靠且具隱私性的智能家居解決方案，可透過 Apple Home app 管理，無需額外帳號。所有配件支援 Thread 標準，門鎖更支援 Matter 和 Aliro，確保核心存取功能即使離線也能運作。產品線包含 LG 的多款攝影機、門鎖、恆溫器等，可透過 Apple HomeView、HomePod 或 Apple TV 4K 等家庭中樞監控。攝影機支援高達 2.5K 解析度，並可識別人物、寵物等，相關歷史記錄儲存在 iCloud+ 方案。此外，門鎖支援 Ultra Wideband 技術，可實現用戶靠近時自動解鎖。Apple 強調 Home app 中的所有數據都經過端到端加密，確保隱私性。該系列配件預計於 12 月開始上市，部分產品至 2027 年初才會到貨。",
    tags: ["Apple", "LG Electronics", "Schneider Electric", "Apple Home Collection", "Matter", "Thread", "智能家居"],
    title_en: "Apple Announces Apple Home Collection, Collaborating with LG and Schneider Electric to Launch Smart Home Accessories",
    summary_en: "Apple announced the Apple Home Collection, a series of smart home accessories including cameras, thermostats, and door locks, developed in collaboration with two third-party companies: LG Electronics and Schneider Electric. The collection aims to provide users with a simple, reliable, and private smart home solution that can be managed through the Apple Home app without requiring an additional account. All accessories support the Thread standard, and the door locks also support Matter and Aliro, ensuring that core access functions remain operational even when offline. The product line includes various LG cameras, door locks, and thermostats, which can be monitored via home hubs such as Apple HomeView, HomePod, or Apple TV 4K. The cameras support up to 2.5K resolution and can identify people, pets, and other objects, with related history stored in the iCloud+ plan. Furthermore, the door locks support Ultra Wideband technology, enabling automatic unlocking when the user is nearby. Apple emphasized that all data within the Home app is end-to-end encrypted, ensuring privacy. The series of accessories is expected to go on sale in December, with some products not arriving until early 2027.",
