    category: "重點關注",
    title: "Google Gemini 4 Argon 模型開始滾動發布，初期僅限付費用戶使用",
    summary: "Google 近期公開了 Gemini 4 Argon 模型，由於其潛在的惡意用途風險，Google 原本計畫謹慎發布。然而，Google 宣布 Argon 已開始廣泛滾動發布，但目前僅限付費訂閱用戶使用，且即使是低階方案的用戶也無法獲得完全存取權。該模型的能力並未改變，Google 仍強調其在推理和代理式編碼方面的先進能力。為應對潛在的惡意指令，模型被訓練為拒絕惡意操作，並配備了自動化不一致性監控器，一旦偵測到非預期工作流程將會停止處理。Google 舉例說明 Argon 在內部應用上的成功，包括優化 YouTube 留言系統，透過移除冗餘的 emoji 渲染，使伺服器負載降低了 45%。此外，它還被用於 Project Wing 的無人機物理模擬器，發現了自 2018 年以來存在的關鍵程式碼錯誤，並提升了機器人學的具體推理能力。",
    tags: ["Google", "Gemini 4 Argon", "AI 模型", "大型語言模型", "AI 應用", "付費訂閱"],
    title_en: "Google Gemini 4 Argon Model Begins Rolling Release, Initially Limited to Paid Subscribers",
    summary_en: "Google recently unveiled the Gemini 4 Argon model. Due to its potential for malicious use, Google originally planned a cautious release. However, Google announced that Argon has begun a widespread rolling release, but access is currently restricted to paid subscribers, and even users on lower-tier plans cannot gain full access. The model's capabilities remain unchanged, and Google emphasizes its advanced abilities in reasoning and agentic coding. To address potential malicious instructions, the model has been trained to refuse malicious operations and is equipped with an automated inconsistency monitor that will halt processing upon detecting unexpected workflows. Google provided examples of Argon's successful internal applications, including optimizing the YouTube comment system, which reduced server load by 45% by removing redundant emoji rendering. Furthermore, it was used for Project Wing's drone physical simulator, where it discovered a critical code bug that had existed since 2018, and enhanced specific reasoning capabilities in robotics.",
