    title: "IREE 3.12 重大更新：重寫 Vulkan 驅動程式並新增實驗性 AMD HSA HAL 支援",
    summary: "IREE（Intermediate Representation Execution Environment）發布了 3.12 版本，作為一個基於 MLIR 的端到端編譯器和執行時環境，用於將機器學習模型轉換為統一的 IR，並能在多種硬體/驅動堆疊上運行。本次更新的重點是重寫了 Vulkan 驅動程式，該新程式碼針對 Vulkan 1.3，並具備原生佇列路徑（native queue paths）、推式描述符（push descriptors）和描述符無關的緩衝區設備位址分派 ABI。透過此新路徑，現在支援了 Raspberry Pi 使用的 Broadcom VideoCore VII GPU，此外也新增了對 Arm Mali 5th Gen 和 LLVMpipe 的支援。此外，IREE 3.12 還引入了一個實驗性且可選的原生 HSA HAL 驅動程式，這是一個使用 HSA 佇列和 AQL 封包的直接 HSA/ROCR 後端。在 CPU 後端方面，本次版本也更新了編譯器代碼，加入了 NVIDIA 的 Ada 和 Blackwell 目標，以及 AMD CDNA5/MI455X 和 RDNA3 晶片細節，顯著擴展了其硬體支援範圍。",
    tags: ["IREE", "MLIR", "Vulkan", "AMD", "HSA", "LLVM"],
    title_en: "IREE 3.12 Major Update: Rewrites Vulkan Driver and Adds Experimental AMD HSA HAL Support",
    summary_en: "IREE (Intermediate Representation Execution Environment) has released version 3.12. As an end-to-end compiler and runtime environment based on MLIR, it is used to convert machine learning models into a unified IR, allowing them to run on various hardware/driver stacks. The focus of this update is the rewrite of the Vulkan driver. This new code targets Vulkan 1.3 and features native queue paths, push descriptors, and a descriptor-agnostic buffer device address dispatch ABI. This new path now supports the Broadcom VideoCore VII GPU used on Raspberry Pi. Furthermore, support for Arm Mali 5th Gen and LLVMpipe has been added. Additionally, IREE 3.12 introduces an experimental and optional native HSA HAL driver, which is a direct HSA/ROCR backend using HSA queues and AQL packages. On the CPU backend side, this version also updates the compiler code, adding support for NVIDIA's Ada and Blackwell targets, as well as details for AMD CDNA5/MI455X and RDNA3 chips, significantly expanding its hardware support scope.",
    tags_en: ["IREE", "MLIR", "Vulkan", "AMD", "HSA", "LLVM"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Phoronix", url: "https://phoronix.com/news/IREE-3.12-Released", lang: "EN" }
    ]
