    title: "쿠도커뮤니케이션 HEALLO：從非接觸生體訊號分析拓展至公共安全與物理監控應用",
    summary: "쿠도커뮤니케이션透過其非接觸式生體訊號分析解決方案 HEALLO，正積極探索將技術應用範圍從傳統的醫療健康領域擴展至公共安全與物理監控領域。HEALLO的核心技術是遠程光血流測量（rPPG），它能透過分析攝像頭拍攝的臉部影像中微小的血流變化，來非接觸地估計心率和血氧飽和度等生體指標。該方案已取得GS認證1級和韓國情報通信技術協會（TTA）的數位醫療/健康支援設備性能認證，證明了其軟體品質和生體訊號測量性能。公司計劃將其技術與現有的影像分析AI和智慧監控技術融合，特別著重於比較個體在不同狀態（如基準狀態與特定情境前後）的生體訊號變化趨勢。主要的潛在應用場景包括嫌犯調查室、機場出入境檢驗櫃檯和海關審訊空間。然而，公司強調，此技術僅提供參考資訊，不能單憑心率變化等數據來做出關於陳述真偽、是否說謊或走私嫌疑的絕對判斷。未來，公司將持續進行環境性能驗證、法律適宜性、個人隱私保護等多方面評估，並規劃結合行動與運動數據進行多模態分析，以擴展其在公共安全領域的應用。",
    tags: ["쿠도커뮤니케이션", "HEALLO", "rPPG", "非接觸生體訊號", "公共安全", "智慧監控"],
    title_en: "Kudocommunication's HEALLO: Expanding Non-Contact Biometric Analysis from Healthcare to Public Safety and Physical Surveillance Applications",
    summary_en: "Kudocommunication is actively exploring expanding the application scope of its non-contact biometric analysis solution, HEALLO, from traditional healthcare into the domains of public safety and physical surveillance. HEALLO's core technology is remote photoplethysmography (rPPG), which non-contact estimates vital signs such as heart rate and blood oxygen saturation by analyzing subtle blood flow variations in facial images captured by cameras. The solution has obtained Class 1 GS certification and performance certification for digital medical/health support equipment from the Telecommunications Technology Association (TTA) of Korea, validating its software quality and biometric measurement performance. The company plans to integrate its technology with existing image analysis AI and smart surveillance technologies, focusing particularly on tracking trends in biometric signal changes for individuals across different states (e.g., baseline versus specific situational contexts). Key potential application scenarios include suspect interrogation rooms, airport entry/exit checkpoints, and customs interrogation spaces. However, the company emphasizes that this technology only provides reference information and cannot make absolute judgments regarding the truthfulness of statements, deception, or smuggling suspicion based solely on heart rate changes. Moving forward, the company will continue to conduct environmental performance validation, legal suitability, and personal privacy protection assessments, planning to combine it with motion and activity data for multimodal analysis to expand its application in the public safety sector.",
    tags_en: ["Kudocommunication", "HEALLO", "rPPG", "Non-Contact Biometrics", "Public Safety", "Smart Surveillance"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Boannews 韓國", url: "https://boannews.com/news/articleView.html?idxno=146337", lang: "EN" }
    ]
