    category: "研討活動",
    title: "金融情報保護院舉辦 FISCON 2026，聚焦 AI 時代金融安全與零信任戰略",
    summary: "金融情報保護院（금융보안원）宣布將於下月 12 日在韓國的 Conrad Seoul 酒店舉辦國內最大的金融情報保護大會「FISCON 2026」。本次活動以「Now for Next Finance」為主題，旨在探討在 AI 重塑的未來金融環境中，應如何建立新的安全戰略。鑑於近期金融領域不斷發生的入侵事件，以及 AI 帶來的複雜網路威脅，本次會議將重點討論前瞻性的安全體系轉型。活動邀請了 AI 安全領域的權威學者，探討 AI 如何改變網路攻擊模式及金融業的應對方向。此外，全球金融安全專家將提出「零信任」（Zero Trust）在 AI 時代的核心重要性及國內的應用方案，並介紹政府推動的專用 AI Foundation Model 發展方向。會議內容涵蓋金融模式變革、AI 應用安全策略，以及如何利用 AI 強化對抗多代理人滲透測試等高階駭客攻擊。",
    tags: ["금융보안원", "FISCON 2026", "AI安全", "零信任", "金融情報保護"],
    title_en: "Korea Financial Security Institute to Host FISCON 2026, Focusing on Financial Security and Zero Trust Strategies in the AI Era",
    summary_en: "The Korea Financial Security Institute (KFI) announced that it will host \"FISCON 2026,\" the largest domestic financial security conference, at the Conrad Seoul hotel in Korea on the 12th of next month. With the theme \"Now for Next Finance,\" the event aims to explore how new security strategies should be established in the future financial environment reshaped by AI. Given the recent increase in intrusion incidents in the financial sector and the complex cyber threats posed by AI, the conference will focus on proactive security system transformation. The event has invited authoritative scholars in AI security to discuss how AI is changing cyber attack patterns and the financial industry's corresponding response. Furthermore, global financial security experts will present the core importance and domestic application plans for \"Zero Trust\" in the AI era, and introduce the direction of government-led development of specialized AI Foundation Models. The conference content will cover financial model transformation, AI application security strategies, and how to utilize AI to strengthen defenses against advanced hacker attacks, such as multi-agent penetration testing.",
